```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as afl-fuzz
    participant F as fork server
    participant C as child process

    F->>A: status word (map size, features)
    A->>F: go signal (4 bytes)

    loop per testcase
        A->>F: go signal (4 bytes)
        F->>F: fork()
        F->>C: exec target binary
        F->>A: child PID (4 bytes)
        A-->>A: continues own work
        C-->>C: runs, fills bitmap
        C->>F: exits (wstatus)
        F->>A: wstatus (4 bytes)
        A-->>A: score, detect crashes
    end
```